        "name": "Hmc7044",
        "specializes": [
          "HwPart"
        ],
        "comments": [
          "14 output channels. Each channel can be configured as a device clock or as SYSREF; the usual pairing is used here: even channels device clocks, odd channels SYSREF. Output frequencies depend on how the chip is configured in each system, so they are not set here."
        ],
        "metadata": [
          {
            "type": "Datasheet",
